WEBVTT

1
00:01:27.889 --> 00:01:29.068
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hi, Ben!

2
00:01:32.431 --> 00:01:35.769
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Wow. You look great.

3
00:01:38.053 --> 00:01:39.785
I love your jacket.

4
00:01:40.738 --> 00:01:45.858
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks. You too. Nice T-shirt.

5
00:01:49.171 --> 00:01:52.208
Sorry, but you need to wear this helmet.

6
00:01:59.649 --> 00:02:01.343
You can ride a bike, right?

7
00:02:01.744 --> 00:02:03.526
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Of course I can ride a bike!

8
00:02:05.333 --> 00:02:11.331
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> So, where do you want to go?

9
00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:16.200
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> It’s your city. I’m a tourist.

10
00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:20.366
I’m in your hands.

11
00:02:20.592 --> 00:02:22.173
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> That’s dangerous.

12
00:02:24.482 --> 00:02:28.347
Well, what do you want to see?

13
00:02:30.706 --> 00:02:33.141
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I want to see the real London.

14
00:02:33.668 --> 00:02:39.415
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> The real London? OK. Let’s go.

15
00:02:39.866 --> 00:02:41.059
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Where are we going?

16
00:02:41.084 --> 00:02:41.717
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Follow me.

17
00:03:24.639 --> 00:03:25.756
This is a great shop.

18
00:03:27.475 --> 00:03:32.695
They always have interesting clothes. Do you want to go in?

19
00:03:36.033 --> 00:03:36.711
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Sure.